graphify-out/
CLAUDE.md
.claude/settings.json
/unarr-desktop
/unarr-desktop.exe

# `unarr support-bundle` writes here by default. Redacted, but still a dump of
# someone's machine — it has no business in a commit.
unarr-support-*.tar.gz
